{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EsD2mf4VV66BFYWxtBnTjF","type":"tool_result","content":"> ★ **Fixed Point:** **You must have an Ingress controller to satisfy an Ingress. Only creating an Ingress resource has no effect** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24].\n**An Ingress controller is responsible for fulfilling the Ingress, usually with a load balancer, though it may also configure your edge router or additional frontends to help handle the traffic** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24]. There it is: §1's \nYou may deploy any number of ingress controllers in a cluster, using **ingress class** to tell them apart [source: k8s-docs-ingress-controllers-2026-08-24]. Ingresses can be implemented by different controllers, often with different configuration, so **each In\n  controller: example.com/ingress-controller\n**Ideally, all Ingress controllers should fit the reference specification. In reality, the various Ingress controllers operate slightly differently** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24].","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"63f373ff-86db-43bd-953d-659db0acabb5","uuid":"877d3bd5-a030-4592-809c-cde264e8dad9","timestamp":"2026-08-25T06:19:28.613Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"> ★ **Fixed Point:** **You must have an Ingress controller to satisfy an Ingress. Only creating an Ingress resource has no effect** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24].\n**An Ingress controller is responsible for fulfilling the Ingress, usually with a load balancer, though it may also configure your edge router or additional frontends to help handle the traffic** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24]. There it is: §1's \nYou may deploy any number of ingress controllers in a cluster, using **ingress class** to tell them apart [source: k8s-docs-ingress-controllers-2026-08-24]. Ingresses can be implemented by different controllers, often with different configuration, so **each In\n  controller: example.com/ingress-controller\n**Ideally, all Ingress controllers should fit the reference specification. In reality, the various Ingress controllers operate slightly differently** [source: k8s-docs-ingress-depth-2026-08-24].","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
